            "text": "Rotozest is a reputed rotary gear pump manufacturer offering both Cast Iron (CI) and Stainless Steel (SS) rotary gear pumps. These pumps are engineered for precise, efficient fluid transfer in industries like chemical processing, food and beverage, oil and gas, pharmaceuticals, agriculture, and more."
