        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Why should I choose Rotozest as my rotary gear pump supplier in all India?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "As a trusted rotary gear pump supplier in all India, Rotozest combines industry-grade materials, advanced manufacturing, and extensive quality checks to ensure durable performance. Our customer-centric support and on-time delivery make us a preferred choice across Indian industries and beyond."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Where is Rotozest located and do they offer a rotary gear pump in Ahmedabad?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes - Rotozest manufactures and supplies a high-quality rotary gear pump in Ahmedabad as well as across the country. Our facility in Ahmedabad enables rapid support and distribution to industrial clients throughout Gujarat and India."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What industries use Rotozest rotary gear pumps?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Rotozest’s rotary gear pumps are widely used in industries such as oil &amp; gas, chemical processing, pharmaceuticals, food &amp; beverage, agriculture, paints &amp; dyes, and more due to their reliability in handling viscous and sensitive fluids."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do rotary gear pumps from Rotozest work?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Rotary gear pumps are positive-displacement pumps that transfer fluid through the meshing action of gears. This design ensures a smooth flow, excellent suction capability, and consistent performance even with high-viscosity liquids."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Can I get customized solutions from Rotozest as a rotary gear pump manufacturer?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes - Rotozest offers customization of rotary gear pumps based on your specific application needs, materials, and operating conditions to ensure optimal performance and reliability."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is Rotozest a trusted gear pump supplier in all India for export and domestic needs?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Absolutely. Rotozest serves as a leading gear pump supplier in all India, delivering high-quality rotary gear pump solutions to industrial clients nationwide and supporting international requirements with reliable products and service."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What types of fluids can Rotozest rotary gear pumps handle?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Rotozest rotary gear pumps are designed to handle a wide range of fluids - from viscous oils and syrups to corrosive chemicals and food-grade liquids - making them highly versatile for multiple industrial processes."
          }
        },
