    {
      "t": "h1",
      "text": "Welcome to Rotozest Your Trusted Partner in Rotary Gear Pump Manufacturer in Ahmedabad"
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "At Rotozest, we pride ourselves on being one of the leading manufacturers and suppliers of high-quality Cast Iron (CI) and Stainless Steel (SS) rotary gear pumps. With a legacy of excellence and a commitment to precision, we serve industries with durable, reliable, and efficient pump solutions that enhance productivity and performance.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Founded with the vision of delivering top-notch pumping solutions, Rotozest is a name trusted by industries for its cutting-edge technology and robust products. Under the leadership of Hitesh Bhai Patel, Bharat Bhai Patel, and Raj Bhai Patel, we have consistently grown by offering innovative and efficient rotary gear pumps that cater to a variety of industrial applications.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Our dedication to superior quality, customer-centric service, and technological innovation makes us a preferred choice in the market. Whether you require pumps for transferring viscous fluids, oil, or chemicals, we have the solution tailored to your needs.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Our Products",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/16-r1fvn5l5s8ll6o3cf22ry9rhccc15sgy6w3drtd2ag.png",
      "alt": "SS Rotary Gear Pump",
      "title": "SS Rotary Gear Pump",
      "w": "380",
      "h": "380",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "SS Rotary Gear Pumps",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Our Stainless Steel (SS) rotary gear pumps are corrosion-resistant, making them ideal for industries requiring hygiene and precision. These pumps are perfect for applications involving corrosive fluids, chemicals, and food-grade materials, ensuring longevity and reliability.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "CI Rotary Gear Pumps",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Known for their excellent performance and durability, our Cast Iron (CI) rotary gear pumps are designed for a wide range of applications. They provide efficient, reliable, and cost-effective solutions for industries handling oils, syrups, and viscous liquids.",
      "html": null
    },
    {
      "t": "img",
      "src": "https://www.rotozest.com/wp-content/uploads/elementor/thumbs/17-r1fvn5l5s8ll6o3cf22ry9rhccc15sgy6w3drtd2ag.png",
      "alt": "CI Rotary Gear Pump Supplier",
      "title": "CI Rotary Gear Pump Supplier",
      "w": "380",
      "h": "380",
      "srcset": ""
    },
    {
      "t": "p",
      "text": "Each pump we manufacture undergoes rigorous quality checks to ensure superior performance and durability, meeting the highest industry standards.",
      "html": null
